                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b9dfa3f5-28e9-3a68-9d7c-b467eb8a8dfb",
                        "entry_id": "6fb942bc-71bd-3aa6-951a-ddfa5adcc56c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "post-acne, resulting from acne"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "493f5c90-88aa-40ee-bb45-e84265c2d63f",
                                "sense_id": "b9dfa3f5-28e9-3a68-9d7c-b467eb8a8dfb",
                                "text": "blizna potrądzikowa",
                                "translation": "acne scars",
                                "english": "acne scars"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "65f17a20-4658-4ed3-ada1-9f0430175a3b",
                                "sense_id": "b9dfa3f5-28e9-3a68-9d7c-b467eb8a8dfb",
                                "text": "Wstrzyknięciami z kolagenu spłycamy zmarszczki mimiczne - poziome i pionowe na czole, przy ustach, drobne kreseczki pod nosem i \"kurze łapki\" w zewnętrznym kąciku oka. Wypełniamy blizny, np. potrądzikowe. Można uwypuklić wargi, robi to z pewnością wiele aktorek i modelek.",
                                "translation": "Collagen injections reduce mimic wrinkles - horizontal and vertical on the forehead, around the mouth, fine lines under the nose and \"crow's feet\" in the outer corner of the eye. We fill scars, e.g. acne scars. You can emphasize the lips, certainly many actresses and models do it.",
                                "english": "Collagen injections reduce mimic wrinkles - horizontal and vertical on the forehead, around the mouth, fine lines under the nose and \"crow's feet\" in the outer corner of the eye. We fill scars, e.g. acne scars. You can emphasize the lips, certainly many actresses and models do it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e94e152-7ac8-4d14-9845-d37808a646f1",
                                "sense_id": "b9dfa3f5-28e9-3a68-9d7c-b467eb8a8dfb",
                                "text": "Świetnie maskuje tłustą cerę oraz zmiany potrądzikowe.",
                                "translation": "It perfectly masks oily skin and post-acne changes.",
                                "english": "It perfectly masks oily skin and post-acne changes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b9322fd-9158-4e11-988b-81d6813964e7",
                                "sense_id": "b9dfa3f5-28e9-3a68-9d7c-b467eb8a8dfb",
                                "text": "Zdarza się, że w leczeniu nie wystarcza tylko stosowanie leków, konieczne jest również wspomaganie leczenia podstawowego takimi zabiegami jak: peeling, dokładne oczyszczanie, a często też po \"wyciszeniu\" wykwitów usuwanie blizn potrądzikowych.",
                                "translation": "It happens that the treatment is not sufficient only with the use of drugs, it is also necessary to support the basic treatment with such procedures as: peeling, thorough cleansing, and often after \"silencing\" the efflorescence, removing acne scars.",
                                "english": "It happens that the treatment is not sufficient only with the use of drugs, it is also necessary to support the basic treatment with such procedures as: peeling, thorough cleansing, and often after \"silencing\" the efflorescence, removing acne scars."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
